		{
			title: "The Dark Bosses"
			x: 0.75d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&dThe Abyss is run by two bosses, and given this is the first Tier 2 world in the FOP Game server... they are a bit higher on the corporate ladder."
				""
				"&5In essence, these two run the propoganda machine for The FOP. Well, one of them, since the FOP has multiple groups targetting different areas."
				""
				"&dBefore anything, though, you'll need a few items to get their attention. The first is easy: Those tall tentacles that dot the Abyss? Sometimes they have an Eye in them... and rarely, the RED ones will drop a Strange Eye."
				""
				"&5JUST the RED ones, mind Bandit. The other item is a bit more... dangerous. You'll need some Nightmare Flakes and ANY Enchanted Book, then find a Web Reaper."
				""
				"&dRight Click the Nightmare Flakes on the Web Reaper to Empower it. Then the Enchanted Book to turn it into a Book of Shadows."
			]
			dependencies: ["00DFF207973776CB"]
			id: "45888F1E14D8B87A"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "4BE07048F64653ED"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:staring_eye"
				}
				{
					id: "3703667596E4A6C7"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:book_of_shadows"
				}
			]
			rewards: [{
				id: "5F1485FF015F8F57"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "The Master of Deception"
			x: 2.75d
			y: -2.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dElusive used to control one of the many astroturfing groups for The FOP. They were good at creating fake accounts, causing arguments within actual communities and fanning the flames as much as possible."
				""
				"&5The arguments were good at sowing discord, and they'd avoid the main arguements with 'friendlier' accounts and make the FOP seem less problematic and more... fair."
				""
				"&dDidn't 'always' work but, it worked enough that they expanded and merged two of their astroturfing into one big propoganda campaign, and gave them offices in The Abyss."
				""
				"&5That's how Elusive gained the nickname The Master of Deception."
			]
			dependencies: ["45888F1E14D8B87A"]
			id: "49A1C4E19D33E3D1"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2F4E1D8E7B96612D"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:staring_eye"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Dark Master"
			x: 2.75d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5The Shadowlord used to run some of the smear campaigns for the FOP, with a small group of very dedicated workers."
				""
				"&dThey'd go around, creating and promoting lies about rival corporations, competitors, and critics."
				""
				"&5They tried it with The Ferret Business for a while, but it didn't work out well for them. They decided to try other tactics instead. Other companies are not as lucky."
				""
				"&dEventually the FOP merged a few of their smaller groups together to form a much larger propaganda group. The two leaders were given joint control of The Abyss for their work."
			]
			dependencies: ["45888F1E14D8B87A"]
			id: "00F513A8216A7A38"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5412B737957F707A"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:book_of_shadows"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Bot Account Jutsu"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -3.0d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&5If you want to fight Elusive, you'll need to find one of their Illusion Trees, super tall trees with an Illusion Altar inside. When you are ready, Right Click the Strange Eye onto the Altar, and Elusive will appear close by."
				""
				"&dNow, Elusive attacks in melee, and will summon clones of themselves to fight you as well. They don't have as much health, but do damage and Blind you, letting Elusive teleport away sometimes."
				""
				"&5Oh, and the clones EXPLODE when they die. Important to remember..."
				""
