			y: -1.25d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS BRIBE"
			description: [
				"&5As much as I'd rather we don't help out the FOP with its propoganda, we don't have too many options. If you want to get on Elusive's good side, you'll need to grow their servers a bit."
				""
				"&dThat and since we're working to implode everything from the inside, this is temporary at best, Bandit. Ten computers, with disk drive, disk, storage, cables, and a Wireless transmitter each should be good."
				""
				"&5Also some Generators to power them. Two computers to a generator. And some security cameras for measure."
				""
				"&dHey... hand me those some of that stuff before you ship it over... I'll sneak the Aubudon Worm onto them. If we're lucky, Elusive will connect them to the FOP network and we'll have another spreading point as well."
