			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&5To face the Shadowlord, you'll need to find one of the Shadowlord Platforms. These are small and up rise up into the air a bit, so are hard to find. But look for dark grey/black squares on your map and you might find one."
				""
				"&dRight Click the Book of Shadows onto the Shadow Altar to summon the Shadowlord. They'll fly around you and launches explosive projectiles."
				""
				"&5One of those hits you, it'll stick Wither, Poison, and Nausea on ya, Bandit. "
